@startnwdiag
' House preamble for subnet and address maps (nwdiag). Start from this file, edit below the
' end marker. nwdiag draws each network as a horizontal bus and each host as a box hanging from
' the buses it joins: its lines are straight vertical drops, not routed, so linetype does not
' apply. Write only the addresses and networks the sources state; leave the rest out.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
legend { BackgroundColor transparent; LineColor $LEGEND_FRAME }
</style>
' house-preamble-end
